A||||29||Greg Piet||Wining about my/my fieros misfortune||||9||
Z||000000||Greg Piet||12-20-1999||07:02 PM||||Since I love this place i feel cozy enough to whine here, so here it goes. <BR>I went out today to my fiero, and i noticed the passenger door didnt look closed properly as i approached.<BR>I knew i had all the doors locked the night before, besides the passenger door never gets opened or unlocked.<P>Well I got to the window and my radio was gone and the center pod fascia was destroyed, and my passenger door was unlocked.  Very confusing since I re keyed the doors when i got the car, and i KNOW it was locked<P>grrrrr  friggin thieves!<P>Good thing is that they didnt take the 12 disc changer behind the seat or the gtech accelerometer in the center glove box or the radar detector in the driver door pocket<P>ok im done whining!   Thanks for you time<P>PS.  I emailed tom for a replacement fascia, but if he doesnt have one does anyne else have a silver center pod fascia for sale?||||reg||9
Z||000001||four50four||12-20-1999||07:40 PM||||errr.. i HATE theives. they are the lowest degree of bacteria invested, scum-sucking maggots. i HATE 'em!!!!||||reg||8
Z||000002||Cliff Pennock||12-20-1999||08:26 PM||||That really, really sucks. I'm against violence in any form, but the first guy I catch breaking into my car gets his head ripped off!!! I despise people who find it necessary to destroy other people's property. My previous car was broken into nine times in 6 months, until finally they decided to steal the car itself. The guy was caught driving my car eventually, but because they couldn't prove he was actually the one who stole my car - he claimed he <B>found</B> it (no, really!) - they let him go (typical dutch justice). He wasn't even fined or jailed for driving a stolen car.<P>Yes, I hate thieves too.||||reg||8
